  (text "CEMS core board, rev 0.1 schematic (draft for review)\nTwo separate Ethernet networks: client port = STM32H573 MAC + LAN8742A (J2); I/O port = W5500 (J3), I/O boards only.\n24 VDC in; DIN-rail enclosure behind the RVT70 display (FFC J4).\nPin map and design notes: docs/CORE_PCB.md. Parts marked CHECK in the sheet notes need datasheet confirmation before layout."
